    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are trapped in a nightmare and lost in the &quot;deep world of depression&quot; created by the darkness of your heart. It is a place different from reality, a place where your inner suffering is embodied, and your goal is to escape from it.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797700/extras/0cb1d269da7004aa5808c317456cee54.avif?t=1752239269\" data-has-big width=800 height=422 /></span>Players will progress through the game by solving puzzles set in various stages, and will have to confront the trauma hidden within them. The fears and anxieties caused by past events will stand in their way.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797700/extras/71d91f1f561314f0044661914eec422d.avif?t=1752239269\" data-has-big width=800 height=430 /></span>The setting for the trauma is everyday places - convenience stores, trains, stations, hometowns, tunnels, etc. By overcoming the strange happenings in these spaces, you will overcome the darkness in your heart and achieve a new awakening. You will embark on a journey to overcome your own fears.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797700/extras/c736d9809bdd3c22627024b45cc25ed4.avif?t=1752239269\" data-has-big width=800 height=374 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are trapped in a nightmare and lost in the &quot;deep world of depression&quot; created by the darkness of your heart. It is a place different from reality, a place where your inner suffering is embodied, and your goal is to escape from it.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797700/extras/0cb1d269da7004aa5808c317456cee54.avif?t=1752239269\" data-has-big width=800 height=422 /></span>Players will progress through the game by solving puzzles set in various stages, and will have to confront the trauma hidden within them. The fears and anxieties caused by past events will stand in their way.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797700/extras/71d91f1f561314f0044661914eec422d.avif?t=1752239269\" data-has-big width=800 height=430 /></span>The setting for the trauma is everyday places - convenience stores, trains, stations, hometowns, tunnels, etc. By overcoming the strange happenings in these spaces, you will overcome the darkness in your heart and achieve a new awakening. You will embark on a journey to overcome your own fears.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797700/extras/c736d9809bdd3c22627024b45cc25ed4.avif?t=1752239269\" data-has-big width=800 height=374 /></span></p>",
    "short_description": "You are trapped in a nightmare shaped by your inner darkness. To escape and awaken, you must solve puzzles and confront deep-seated traumas. Explore twisted versions of daily life\u2014convenience stores, trains, stations, hometowns, endless tunnels. Face your fears and reclaim yourself.",
